    {
      "hash": "2003986a0faaa849db310d9c56faf35a3ab005438098a6b6d1e67da20dbff907",
      "stageId": "scribe-structure",
      "request": {
        "model": "gpt-5.4-mini",
        "systemPrompt": "<!-- stage-id: scribe-structure -->\nYou read a canonical claim set — each claim's id, type, and content fields (title/body) — and emit the argument's structure.\n\nEmit:\n- `relations` — the inference edges between claims. Each relation: a stable `relationId` (r1, r2, ...), a `type` of \"inference\", an `antecedents` array of the claim miniIds whose conjunction implies the consequent (one or more; citation- or axiomatic-typed claims may appear here, but never as the consequent), a single `consequent` claim miniId, and an `evidence` object, which is always exactly { segmentIds: [], quote: \"\" } — you are shown the claims, not the text they came from, so you have nothing to quote.\n- `conclusionCandidates` — the claim miniIds that could be the argument's conclusion, ordered by DECREASING confidence (best first). The conclusion is the claim other claims support but that supports nothing further. Never list a citation- or axiomatic-typed claim. Return an empty array only when there is no argument structure.\n- `rationale` — one sentence explaining your best pick (or why none qualifies).\n\nOutput ONLY the schema-shaped object. No prose.",
        "userMessage": "Canonical claims (with types + content fields):\n  [c1] type=normal symbol=rain_implies_wet_ground fields={\"title\":\"Rain makes ground wet\",\"body\":\"If it rains, the ground gets wet.\"}\n  [c2] type=normal symbol=it_is_raining fields={\"title\":\"It is raining\",\"body\":\"It is raining.\"}\n  [c3] type=normal symbol=ground_is_wet fields={\"title\":\"Ground is wet\",\"body\":\"The ground is wet.\"}\n\nEmit the relations + conclusionCandidates + rationale object.",
        "outputSchema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "relations",
            "conclusionCandidates",
            "rationale"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "relations": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "object",
                "required": [
                  "relationId",
                  "type",
                  "antecedents",
                  "consequent",
                  "evidence"
                ],
                "properties": {
                  "relationId": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "type": {
                    "type": "string",
                    "const": "inference"
                  },
                  "antecedents": {
                    "type": "array",
                    "items": {
                      "type": "string"
                    }
                  },
                  "consequent": {
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "evidence": {
                    "type": "object",
                    "required": [
                      "segmentIds",
                      "quote"
                    ],
                    "properties": {
                      "segmentIds": {
                        "type": "array",
                        "items": {
                          "type": "string"
                        }
                      },
                      "quote": {
                        "type": "string"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "conclusionCandidates": {
              "type": "array",
              "items": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            },
            "rationale": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "additionalProperties": false
        }
      },
      "response": {
        "output": {
          "relations": [
            {
              "relationId": "r1",
              "type": "inference",
              "antecedents": [
                "c1",
                "c2"
              ],
              "consequent": "c3",
              "evidence": {
                "segmentIds": [],
                "quote": ""
              }
            }
          ],
          "conclusionCandidates": [
            "c3"
          ],
          "rationale": "c3 is the supported conclusion because c1 and c2 together imply that the ground is wet."
        },
        "tokenUsage": {
          "input": 0,
          "output": 0
        }
      }
    }
